# The core's own repository (MicroZ-LLC/AllInOneIME-Core), from a fresh clone of AllInOneIME, with its history:
#
#   git filter-repo --paths-from-file Core/.split-paths
#
# Core/ uses the repository's layout, so the paths its files had before they moved here (0.6.5) need no renames: they
# are kept as they were, and Core/ becomes the root. Paths the macOS shell uses again after the move are left out (the
# file there now is the shell's), so their history from before the move isn't in the core's:
# Resources/Localizable.xcstrings (the whole catalog until the app's text got its own), Sources/allinoneime-cli/main.swift
# (now Sources/AllInOneIMECLI/CLI.swift) and LICENSE, Package.resolved (copies).

# Today's core, as the root.
Core/
Core/==>

# Where its files were before 0.6.5.
Sources/AllInOneIMEText/
Sources/AllInOneIMECore/
Sources/CRime/
Sources/AllInOneIMERime/
Tests/AllInOneIMECoreTests/
Tests/LinuxShims/
Scripts/check-core-portable.sh
Scripts/check-core-portable.py
Scripts/check-core-portable-test.sh
Scripts/core-portable-allowlist.txt
Scripts/make-redaction-words.swift
Scripts/make-eventstream-fixture.py
Scripts/strings.swift
LanguagePacks/
Plugins/
Examples/
.gitattributes

